{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"平展概形态射"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“平展概形态射”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦","text":"平坦概形态射"}},{"Plain":"且"},{"Local":{"url":"非分歧","text":"非分歧概形态射"}},{"Plain":"的概形态射称为平展概形态射.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>概形的开浸入都是平展的.</p>\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/02GH\" title=\"Stacks project [https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/02GH]\">Stacks project</a></span>: 域 $k$ 上的概形 $X$ 的结构态射 $X\\to\\operatorname{Spec}(k)$ 平展当且仅当 $X$ 是 $k$ 的若干有限可分扩域的谱的无交并.</p>\n"}]}}